

>> usedMemory1 := 0.
>> usedMemory2 := 0.
>> usedMemory3 := 0.
>> usedMemory4 := 0.

Eto iṣakoso-iranti: 0.

>> txt := ['Word Salad'].
Ijade kọ: ['last index of ord = '] + (( txt ipo-ikẹhin: ['ord'] ) - 0), ila-tuntun.
Ijade kọ: ['index of ord = '] + (( txt ri: ['ord'] ) - 0), ila-tuntun.
Ijade kọ: ['index of ad = '] + (( txt ri: ['ad'] ) - 0), ila-tuntun.
Ijade kọ: ['last index of W = '] + (( txt ipo-ikẹhin: ['W'] ) - 0), ila-tuntun.
Ijade kọ: ['last index of d = '] + (( txt ipo-ikẹhin: ['d'] ) - 0), ila-tuntun.
Ijade kọ: ['txt equals Word Salad = '] + ( txt = ['Word Salad'] ), ila-tuntun.
Ijade kọ: ['txt equals Ceasar Salad = '] + ( txt = ['Ceasar Salad'] ), ila-tuntun.
Ijade kọ: ['txt does not equal Word Salad = '] + ( txt ≠ ['Word Salad'] ), ila-tuntun.
Ijade kọ: ['txt does not equal Ceasar Salad = '] + ( txt ≠ ['Ceasar Salad'] ), ila-tuntun.

Eto sọ-di-mimọ.

